{"availability":"available","full":"ys941/youtubepilot-ai","name":"youtubepilot-ai","description":"Autonomous, white-label AI worker that runs a YouTube Shorts channel end to end. Invents the topic, writes the script, designs themed slide cards, renders a vertical Short with music and AI voiceover, uploads on your schedule, seeds the first comment and replies to viewers - in any niche, on your own channel and your own API keys. Self-hosted.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":1,"created":"2026-06-16T14:48:51Z","updated":"2026-09-22T17:42:28Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ys941.github.io/youtubepilot-ai/","topics":["ai","automation","content-automation","demo","ffmpeg","gemini","generative-ai","llm","nextjs","postgresql","prisma","saas","self-hosted","text-to-speech","typescript","white-label","youtube","youtube-api","youtube-shorts"],"demo":"https://ys941.github.io/youtubepilot-ai/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.787Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.787Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.787Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.787Z","stars":2,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["▶ Try the live demo — the real dashboard running a fictional cooking channel in your browser. Nothing is uploaded and no AI is called.","Invent ideas → write the script → render multi-slide video cards → stitch a vertical Short with music → write title/tags → schedule & upload → seed comment → auto-reply to viewers — all unattended.","YouTubePilot AI is a production-grade SaaS that fully automates a YouTube Shorts channel end to end: it invents on-topic ideas, writes the script with AI, renders branded multi-slide video cards, stitches them into a vertical Short with music, writes the title/description/tags, uploads on a schedule you set, posts an engagement seed comment, replies to viewer comments, and emails you a daily health report — all unattended. It is white-label and niche-agnostic: cooking, fitness, finance, travel, education, tech, beauty, history, anything. You configure the app name, niche, voice, channel…"],"features":["One-shot channel setup from a description. In Settings → AI Setup, describe the channel you want in plain English. Groq (the content AI lane) then asks 6-10 tailored questions (niche specifics, audience, persona/voice,…","Review before it writes. The generated config is shown as readable Brand / Channel / Persona / Content-types / Topics / Schedule cards; Apply persists it via the normal preferences store (brand-scoped), and you can…","Per-task AI Config — provider + model + fallback chain (per brand). Settings → AI configures three independent task lanes, each an ordered fallback chain of provider · model steps tried top-to-bottom until one succeeds:","Content (contentChain) — scripts, captions, hooks.","Reply (replyChain) — YouTube comment auto-replies."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ys941/youtubepilot-ai/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"089982f4ec58bfd16313969ce3f36c82314df986663a4df491dec01a79a69487","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.889Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.889Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"▶ Try the live demo — the real dashboard running a fictional cooking channel in your browser. Nothing is uploaded and no AI is called.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ys941/youtubepilot-ai/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"You configure the app name, niche, voice, channel handle, and content-type labels entirely from the Settings UI — no code changes — and you bring your own API keys.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ys941/youtubepilot-ai/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"> TL;DR for a new owner: clone → set env keys → log in → Settings → Brand (name, niche, handle) → Settings → AI/Prompts (provider, voice) → Settings → Content Types (labels) → add your channels → set the schedule.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ys941/youtubepilot-ai/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Other tabs: Accounts (add/edit/enable/delete brands), Appearance (pick one of 10 app-wide themes; per-device), Prompts (per-post-type system-prompt overrides + per-account default content prompts), Account / Danger (login key, destructive actions).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ys941/youtubepilot-ai/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"089982f4ec58bfd16313969ce3f36c82314df986663a4df491dec01a79a69487","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ys941/youtubepilot-ai/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.891Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-22T17:42:28Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ys941/youtubepilot-ai/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.894Z","hash":"089982f4ec58bfd16313969ce3f36c82314df986663a4df491dec01a79a69487","originalBytes":61253,"storedBytes":61253,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["youtube","brand","settings","api","content","channel","short","key","app","every","default","own","gemini","groq","run","each","fallback","name","npm","tts","client","comment","env","shorts","one","per","post","publish","types","provider","upload","voice","lib","never","via","cards","day","set","url","build","cloudinary","persona","render","chain","grok","handle","jamendo","next","only","any","card","docker","global","keys","niche","secret","token","captions","database","ffmpeg","login","media","music","off","posts","replies","topics","when","canopy","cerebras","daily","dashboard","data","model","refresh","vision","health","prisma","prompts","public","push","railway","resend","schedule","setup","skin","add","analytics","brands","comments","days","hook","min","path","reply","runs","time","what","email","generate","compose","cover","free","generator","image","oauth","primary","quota","reads","satori","seed","server","today",